# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local analysis working data — stays on disk, never pushed.
# These are GIS intermediates and pipeline scratch, not app inputs.
# The dashboard reads only from public/data/ and src/data/.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# heavy GIS intermediates
_gba_work/
_centrality_rerun/
_what_if_work/jobs/
**/_what_if_work/jobs/

# large binaries: rasters, spatial databases, archives.
# public/data/ is negated because it is the directory the browser
# actually fetches, so its rasters must stay committable.
#
# NOTE: 38 .tif files under json_files/, land_cover_change_analysis/ and
# land_cover_change_analysis_sentinel2/ were committed before this rule
# existed. Git keeps tracking files it already tracks, so they and their
# future edits still version normally — this rule only stops NEW rasters
# from being added by accident. Whether those 38 move to Git LFS or to a
# separate data repo is a deliberate later decision, not settled here.
*.tif
*.tiff
!public/data/**/*.tif
!public/data/**/*.tiff
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.zip

# worker run artifacts
**/last_run_log.txt

# test / lint tooling
playwright-report/
test-results/
coverage/
blob-report/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only research folders and condominium inventory layers.
# public/data/geo/condominiums_*.geojson and the research folders
# stay on disk and are never pushed.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
/site intervention/
/json_files/condo_inventory/
/Social_media_analysis/
public/data/geo/condominiums_*.geojson

